Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

Bitmap fonts (resources/fonts/)
  The .fnt and .png files are generated by tools/fontgen/generate.py from
  Big Shoulders (Copyright 2019 The Big Shoulders Project Authors) and
  Manrope (Copyright 2018 The Manrope Project Authors). Both are licensed
  under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; the license texts are in
  resources/fonts/OFL-BigShoulders.txt and resources/fonts/OFL-Manrope.txt.
  The generated fonts remain under that license, not under Apache-2.0.

Icons (resources/fonts/icons24.*)
  The icons are drawn from the SVG paths in tools/fontgen/generate.py. The
  outline of the heart icon matches the Material Design "favorite" icon
  (Copyright Google, Apache-2.0).

Claude Design runtime (design/claude-design/support.js)
  This file is the runtime of Claude Design, generated by Anthropic's
  Claude Design tool. It is not the work of this project and is not covered
  by the Apache-2.0 license of this repository. It is kept only so that the
  design file "FR265 Watch Face.dc.html" opens in a browser. The design file
  itself is part of this project and is licensed under Apache-2.0.
  HANDOFF-README.md and the thumbnail are Claude Design output and are not
  covered.

Not in this repository
----------------------
  The Garmin Connect IQ SDK, the device files and Garmin's fonts are not
  included and must never be committed: the Connect IQ developer agreement
  does not allow redistributing them. Install them yourself with the
  Connect IQ SDK Manager.

